      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is something that is planned for the UI 2.5 Update, it will be called Udon Hooks. \nIt was mentioned in the dev stream from April last year, you can read more about it here: https://medium.com/vrchat/vrchat-april-2021-dev-stream-recap-8502bb8c9163",
