  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-01-11T05:59:43.202Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Many worlds will have a \"Controls\" board that allows players to toggle certain features of a world. I would love the ability for worlds creators to add these items to the quick menu of the player. This could be implemented to allow quick access to Udon trigger events or set variables without having to make players walk across the world to access a \"Control panel\"",
